    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d475-a2">

                <pb facs="1292" n="1286" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg1286"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 20.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Willis to Mr.
                            Carter.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Honolulu, Hawaiian Islands</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1893-12-26"><hi rendition="#italic">December
                                26, 1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Will you inform Her Majesty the Queen that
                    on the 20th instant, in obedience to my instructions, I notified the President
                    and ministers of the Provisional Government that the President of the United
                    States had reached the decision that she had been illegally deprived of her
                    authority as the constitutional sovereign of the Hawaiian Islands, and that they
                    were expected to promptly relinquish to the Queen her constitutional
                    authority.</p>
                <p>On the 24th instant I received in reply a written communication from the
                    Provisional Government, which was of such a nature that it became my duty, as
                    previously instructed, to submit it to the Secretary of State, Hon. W. Q.
                    Gresham, which was done on the same day.</p>
                <p>With assurances of high regard, I am, sir, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Albert S. Willis</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Envoy Extraordinary and Minister Plenipotentiary,
                            United States of America.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
